# "Add {G} for each creature you control": turn 1 Bot1 has no creature, so tapping Gaea's Cradle adds nothing (it is still tapped, and the empty pool is the result). On turn 3 Bot1 controls Elvish Mystic and Ornithopter (two creatures; Mox Jet,
# a noncreature artifact, does not count) while Bot2 controls two Llanowar Elves (not counted): the Cradle adds exactly {G}{G}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gaea's Cradle
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Llanowar Elves
Mox Emerald
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Cradle.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Tapped = true
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Tapped = true
